Ink Decision v1
Copyright 2026 Tanmay Devare

This package contains the Ink-maintained ModernBERT decision runtime, tokenizer
handling, sequence preparation, choice scoring, prompt assembly, and calibrated
choice-head inference path used by Ink's Decision Engine.

The bundled checkpoint identity is recorded in checkpoint.json. Trained
checkpoint lineage and operating constraints are documented in MODEL_CARD.md.
